WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.081
The Pattern Generator has an Oscilloscope kind: it draws a signal as a glowing trace.

2
00:00:06.081 --> 00:00:10.577
Turn it on over the camera, set Kind to Oscilloscope, and Blend to Add.

3
00:00:11.029 --> 00:00:14.429
A thin trace barely lifts the raster, so make it thick.

4
00:00:14.429 --> 00:00:17.087
Now it rides across the picture as a ridge.

5
00:00:18.164 --> 00:00:23.326
Set the scope's source to Classic Slot, and its reference to one: modulation slot one.

6
00:00:23.782 --> 00:00:25.041
Switch slot one on.

7
00:00:25.041 --> 00:00:26.896
Its sine wave is drawn live.

8
00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:32.912
Change the waveform to a square wave, and the trace snaps between two levels.

9
00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:36.283
Sweep sets how fast the trace crosses the screen.

10
00:00:36.283 --> 00:00:38.127
Persist sets how long it glows.

11
00:00:45.554 --> 00:00:50.247
The scope can also draw audio, a graph node, any parameter, or the beat pulse.

12
00:00:50.702 --> 00:00:55.336
A scope as a video source: any signal in the synth can become the picture.

13
00:00:55.336 --> 00:00:56.526
Next: deeper looks.
